      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, basically, we're talking about a RPO tech. I don't know, really, it would be great for VRChat, but everybody knows that their API isn't as advanced as it always seems at first glance, so I doubt they'd be able to handle this task. I'm certainly not against this suggestion, but I bet they're not going to add anything like that in 10 years.",
