  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-17T13:10:10.373Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat is a international game and the language barrier problem between people is very actual. I offer to add to the game an internal voice translator. At the first step, a person using Speech-to-text engine dictates a whole text he wants to pronounce. After that he can correct it if voice recognition was not good enough. Then electronic translator converts it to another language and Text-to-speech engine output the speech. Of course, the translation quality of the modern electronic translators is not good. In order to improve the translation quality, some buttons can be added to UI in order to point context of the whole speech or some keys words. For example, “common speech”, “foods”, “computers”, “architecture”, “sci-fi”, and so on. Users should also follow some rules. For example, it’s better to use several short sentences than one long.",
